-7be0c2e60925"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Genome-wide association analyses identify 95 risk loci and provide insights into the neurobiology of post-traumatic stress disorder","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-087.61-741800","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Most of the Greenland and Antarctic ice sheets are covered with firn — the transitional material between snow and glacial ice. Firn is vital for understanding ice-sheet mass balance and hydrology, and palaeoclimate. In this Review, we synthesize knowledge of firn, including its formation, observation, modelling and relevance to ice sheets. The refreezing of meltwater in the pore space of firn currently prevents 50% of meltwater in Greenland from running off into the ocean and protects Antarctic ice shelves from catastrophic collapse. Continued atmospheric warming could inhibit future protection against mass loss. For example, warming in Greenland has already contributed to a 5% reduction in firn pore space since 1980. All projections of future firn change suggest that surface meltwater will have an increasing impact on firn, with melt occurring tens to hundreds of kilometres further inland in Greenland, and more extensively on Antarctic ice shelves. Although progress in observation and modelling techniques has led to a well-established understanding of firn, the large uncertainties associated with meltwater percolation processes (refreezing, ice-layer formation and storage) must be reduced further. A tighter integration of modelling components (firn, atmosphere and ice-sheet models) will also be needed to better simulate ice-sheet responses to anthropogenic warming and to quantify future sea-level rise.","author_count":35,"contributors":["Amory, Charles","Buizert, Christo","Buzzard, Sammie","Case, Elizabeth","Clerx, Nicole","Culberg, Riley","Datta, Rajashree Tri","Dey, Rahul","Drews, Reinhard","Dunmire, Devon","Eayrs, Clare","Hansen, Nicolaj","Humbert, Angelika","Kaitheri, Athul","Keegan, Kaitlin","Kuipers Munneke, Peter","Lenaerts, Jan T. M.","Lhermitte, Stef","Mair, Doug","McDowell, Ian","Mejia, Jessica","Meyer, Colin R.","Morris, Elizabeth","Moser, Dorothea","Oraschewski, Falk M.","Pearce, Emma","de Roda Husman, Sophie","Schlegel, Nicole-Jeanne","Schultz, Timm","Simonsen, Sebastian Bjerregaard","Stevens, C. Max","Thomas, Elizabeth R.","Thompson-Munson, Megan","Wever, Nander","Wouters, Bert"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-729532"],"filters":{"added":"2024-05","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, Middle East","Asia, South","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corpau":["The Firn Symposium team"],"country":["Belgium","France","Germany","India","Netherlands","Switzerland","United Arab Emirates","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["Alfred Wegener Institute - Helmholtz Centre for Polar and Marine Research","All Global Affiliations","British Antarctic Survey","California Institute of Technology","Cardiff University","Columbia University","Cornell University","Dartmouth College","Delft University of Technology","KU Leuven","National Centre for Polar and Ocean Research","New York University Abu Dhabi","Oregon State University","Technische Universität Darmstadt","University at Buffalo","University of Cambridge","University of Colorado Boulder","University of Fribourg","University of Grenoble","University of Liverpool","University of Maryland, College Park","University of Nevada, Reno","University of Tübingen","Université Côte d’Azur","Université de Strasbourg","Utrecht University","WSL Institute for Snow and Avalanche Research SLF"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"firn on ice sheets","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85183024076","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-729532","identifier":[{"id":"85183024076","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-464f62b7-cc4d-4fb9-b9b5-7023c85ec6fd"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Techno