15461718"],"issn_org":["10614036"],"issue":"5","journal":"Nature Genetics","pages":"560-572","publisher":"Nature Research","status":"p","title":"Nature Genetics","volume":"54"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85130637871"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-c311f054-cd8c-47bd-a7ee-60cf4940ce8d","au-04d034b2-c833-41e4-8665-f9fb146b8f52","ku-0f852390-b1f2-4e06-8025-9442c43a33a0","sdu-912310f1-1215-4cf9-b624-a07928417dff"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Multi-ancestry genetic study of type 2 diabetes highlights the power of diverse populations for discovery and translation","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-088.44-009381","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"The complexation of MgII with adenosine 5′-triphosphate (ATP) is omnipresent in biochemical energy conversion, but is difficult to interrogate directly. Here we use the spin-urn:x-wiley:14337851:media:anie202207137:anie202207137-math-0001 β-emitter 31Mg to study MgII-ATP complexation in 1-ethyl-3-methylimidazolium acetate (EMIM-Ac) solutions using β-radiation-detected nuclear magnetic resonance (β-NMR). We demonstrate that (nuclear) spin-polarized 31Mg, following ion-implantation from an accelerator beamline into EMIM-Ac, binds to ATP within its radioactive lifetime before depolarizing. The evolution of the spectra with solute concentration indicates that the implanted 31Mg initially bind to the solvent acetate anions, whereafter they undergo dynamic exchange and form either a mono- (31Mg-ATP) or di-nuclear (31MgMg-ATP) complex. The chemical shift of 31Mg-ATP is observed up-field of 31MgMg-ATP, in accord with quantum chemical calculations. These observations constitute a crucial advance towards using β-NMR to probe chemistry and biochemistry in solution.","author_count":25,"contributors":["Mcfadden, Ryan M. L.","Szunyogh, Daniel","Bravo-frank, Nicholas","Chatzichristos, Aris","Dehn, Martin H.","Fujimoto, Derek","Jancsó, Attila","Johannsen, Silke","Kálomista, Ildikó","Karner, Victoria L.","Kiefl, Robert F.","Larsen, Flemming Hofmann","Lassen, Jens","Levy, C. D. Philip","Li, Ruohong","Mckenzie, Iain","Mcphee, Hannah","Morris, Gerald D.","Pearson, Matthew R.","Sauer, Stephan P. A.","Sigel, Roland K. O.","Thulstrup, Peter Waaben","Macfarlane, W. Andrew","Hemmingsen, Lars Bo Stegeager","Stachura, Monika"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-536854"],"filters":{"added":"2022-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"magnesium ii atp complexes in 000000000001 ethyl 000000000003 methylimidazolium acetate solutions characterized by sup 000000000031 sup mg β radiation detected nmr spectroscopy","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202207137","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-536854","identifier":[{"id":"85134269278","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC9539566","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"35718746","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-f055ff81-4bfc-4f08-ae6b-2aac8067cf7d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BEF13E2C14E2C18D42023BD8668A286D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/320017401/Angew_Chem_Int_Ed_2022_McFadden_Magnesium_II_u2010ATP_Complexes_in_1_u2010Ethyl_u20103_u2010Methylimidazolium_Acetate_Solutions.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202207137","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Chemistry, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Ryan M. L.","key":"mcfaddenpau","last":"Mcfadden","name":"Mcfadden, Ryan M. L.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Dániel","key":"szunyoghpau","last":"Szunyogh","locid":"ab2652e4-a5e8-4c2e-b0ad-e19a4166a2d5","name":"Szunyogh, Daniel","name_org":"Szunyogh, Dániel","orcid":"0000-0001-9161-7257","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Nicholas",