{"abstract":"What is the value of evidence-based interventions in addressing “Grand Challenges”? Building upon the EPOS Grand Challenges work (Sakhrani et al., 2017), this paper explores whether evidence-based approaches developed for management and policy are relevant to addressing Grand Challenges. It discusses the criticisms of the Evidence-based Management approach and argues that evidence is a necessary, but not sufficient input in the decisionmaking process of addressing Grand Challenges.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Konstantinou, Efrosyni","Zerjav, Vedran","Kanjanabootra, Sittimont","Teerikangas, Satu","Hellström, Magnus","Thuesen, Christian","Geraldi, Joana","Cornfield, Kimberly","Edkins, Andrew","Nicholls, Daniel","Morris, Peter"],"cuid":["S02-085.19-032247"],"event":{"end":"2019-06-27","place":"Vail, us","start":"2019-06-25","title":"17th Annual Engineering Project Organization Conference. EPOC 2019","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"corresponding_author":["Konstantinou, Efrosyni"],"country":["Australia","Finland","Norway","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Association for Project Management","Association for Project Management (APM)","University College London","University College London (UCL)","University of Agder","University of Newcastle","University of Turku"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"evidence based interventions and strategies for the grand challenges approach the need for judgement","src":["cbs","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.