":"pau"},{"affno":"130","first":"David St","key":"clairdavidstpau","last":"Clair","name":"Clair, David St","rank":295,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"84 114","first":"Daniel R.","key":"weinbergerdanielrpau","last":"Weinberger","name":"Weinberger, Daniel R.","rank":296,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"105","first":"Jens R.","key":"wendlandjensrpau","last":"Wendland","name":"Wendland, Jens R.","rank":297,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"12","first":"Thomas","key":"wergethomaspau","last":"Werge","locid":"905c01bb-6319-4ce6-a38e-ceb5bf73d2f6","name":"Werge, Thomas","rank":298,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","first":"Mark J.","key":"dalymarkjpau","last":"Daly","name":"Daly, Mark J.","rank":299,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"13 36","first":"Patrick F.","key":"sullivanpatrickfpau","last":"Sullivan","name":"Sullivan, Patrick F.","rank":300,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"9","first":"Michael C.","key":"odonovanmichaelcpau","last":"O'donovan","name":"O'donovan, Michael C.","rank":301,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["29977057"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1038/s41598-018-28160-z","issn":["20452322"],"issue":"1","journal":"Scientific Reports","paperid":"10168","publisher":"Nature Publishing Group","status":"p","title":"Scientific Reports","volume":"8"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85049684948"],"sdg":["3. Good Health and Well-being","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","Non-Profit Organisations","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-0fe94978-e54d-4b65-8dc9-718cb05519cc","dtu-8bfd7489-019e-48dc-8d77-0d412d4176fb","ku-8bcfcefd-43aa-4d79-9099-24ffc9a6b71e"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Age at first birth in women is genetically associated with increased risk of schizophrenia","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-086.07-013745","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"We aggregated coding variant data for 81,412 type 2 diabetes cases and 370,832 controls of diverse ancestry, identifying 40 coding variant association signals (P < 2.2 × 10-7); of these, 16 map outside known risk-associated loci. We make two important observations. First, only five of these signals are driven by low-frequency variants: even for these, effect sizes are modest (odds ratio ≤1.29). Second, when we used large-scale genome-wide association data to fine-map the associated variants in their regional context, accounting for the global enrichment of complex trait associations in coding sequence, compelling evidence for coding variant causality was obtained for only 16 signals. At 13 others, the associated coding variants clearly represent 'false leads' with potential to generate erroneous mechanistic inference. Coding variant associations offer a direct route to biological insight for complex diseases and identification of validated therapeutic targets; however, appropriate mechanistic inference requires careful specification of their causal contribution to disease predisposition.","author_count":233,"contributors":["Mahajan, Anubha","Wessel, Jennifer","Willems, Sara M","Zhao, Wei","Robertson, Neil R","Chu, Audrey Y","Gan, Wei","Kitajima, Hidetoshi","Taliun, Daniel","Rayner, N William","Guo, Xiuqing","Lu, Yingchang","Li, Man","Jensen, Richard A","Hu, Yao","Huo, Shaofeng","Lohman, Kurt K","Zhang, Weihua","Cook, James P","Prins, Bram Peter","Flannick, Jason","Grarup, Niels","Trubetskoy, Vassily Vladimirovich","Kravic, Jasmina","Kim, Young Jin","Rybin, Denis V","Yaghootkar, Hanieh","Müller-Nurasyid, Martina","Meidtner, Karina","Li-Gao, Ruifang","Varga, Tibor V","Marten, Jonathan","Li, Jin","Smith, Albert Vernon","An, Ping","Ligthart, Symen","Gustafsson, Stefan","Malerba, Giovanni","Demirkan, Ayse","Tajes, Juan Fernandez","Steinthorsdottir, Valgerdur","Wuttke, Matthias","Lecoeur, Cécile","Preuss, Michael","Bielak, Lawrence F","Graff, Marielisa","High