"DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-efd37390-4803-4a09-8d01-0674f45b518a","sdu-5f551abf-0658-4a76-8f67-20e537c96c39"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Heavier smoking may lead to a relative increase in waist circumference : evidence for a causal relationship from a Mendelian randomisation meta-analysis. The CARTA consortium","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-091.38-047264","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"In conventional full-duplex radio communication systems, the transmitter (Tx) is active at the same time as the receiver (Rx). The isolation between the Tx and the Rx is ensured by duplex filters. However, an increasing number of long-term evolution (LTE) bands crave multiband operation. Therefore, a new front-end architecture, addressing the increasing number of LTE bands, as well as multiple standards, is presented. In such an architecture, the Tx and Rx chains are separated throughout the front-end. Addition of bands is solved by making the antennas and filters tunable. Banks of duplex filters are replaced by tunable filters and antennas, providing a duplexer function over the air between the Tx and the Rx. A hardware system has been designed and fabricated to demonstrate the performance of this front-end architecture. Measurements demonstrate how the architecture addresses inter-modulation and Rx desensitization due to the Tx signal. The filters and antennas demonstrate tunability across multiple bands. System validation is detailed for LTE band I. Frequency response, as well as linearity measurements of the complete Tx and Rx front-end chains, show that the system requirements are fulfilled.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Bahramzy, Pevand","Olesen, Poul","Madsen, Peter","Bøjer, Jørgen","Barrio, Samantha Caporal Del","Tatomirescu, Alexandru","Bundgaard, Peter","Morris, Art","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-106678"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Intel","WiSpry"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a tunable rf front end with narrowband antennas for mobile devices","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-106678","identifier":[{"id":"84959529041","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000362357900031","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-c3220e72-7efa-4a35-ba87-c9fc31d0af0c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-43D1BA95FAC2A519ABD1AD463E1E7952"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"intel","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Intel","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"wispry","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"WiSpry","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Pevand","key":"bahramzypau","last":"Bahramzy","locid":"4231282d-63aa-4829-a6b7-d153b6681578","name":"Bahramzy, Pevand","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Poul","key":"olesenpau","last":"Olesen","name":"Olesen, Poul","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","name":"Madsen, Peter","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Jørgen","key":"bøjerpau","last":"Bøjer","name":"Bøjer, Jørgen","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Samantha Caporal Del","key":"barriopau","last":"Barri